WEBVTT

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.680
A prince named Siegfried 
falls in love at first sight

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:09.680
with a princess named Odette, 
who is cursed to be a swan.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:11.400
The curse can only be broken

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:15.660
if someone who has never loved 
before swears to love Odette.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:19.840
But the prince is tricked by Rothbart, 
the demon who cast the spell,

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:24.320
and swears his love to Rothbart's 
daughter, Odile, instead.

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:30.500
That's basically the story of Swan Lake.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:31.670
Does it make sense?

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:34.150
Huh? Y-Yeah...

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:37.800
Let's go.

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:42.640
<i>Her outfit...</i>

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:47.530
<i>I mean, I'm going out 
one-on-one with a girl!</i>

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:21.490
Act 2: "I Can't Be Friends With Someone Like Him!"

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:23.240
Oikawa Haruka Ballet Company

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:45.460
<i>We will now have a 20-minute intermission.</i>

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:48.080
You slept well. Was it boring?

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:48.810
Huh?!

00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:52.620
Well, no, not boring, exactly...

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:56.260
It seemed like the dancers on 
stage were having fun, but...

00:02:56.260 --> 00:02:58.460
I felt like I was being made 
to watch a school recital,

00:02:58.460 --> 00:03:00.220
and I couldn't really take it anymore.

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:02.070
Who do you think you are,

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:04.200
saying that as you stare at your phone?!

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:09.190
Um, well, a social life's 
important too, y'know?

00:03:09.190 --> 00:03:11.220
I might get messages from
 my club or something.

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:13.930
I would message my friends later,

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:16.850
and I'm in a science club because a 
sports club would take too much time.

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:19.720
I want as much time 
to practice as I can get!

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:22.720
Is this under the old lady's orders?

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:26.930
Mom wouldn't ask for anything like that.

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:30.810
She's already half given up on me.

00:03:32.510 --> 00:03:33.970
Miyako!

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:37.400
Oh, you guys are here, too?

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:39.580
Hello, Miyako-chan.

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:40.580
Hello.

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:44.620
Oh, they're in my class at
 Oikawa Haruka Ballet School.

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:46.620
I go there twice a week.

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:49.500
That boy's a student at my mom's school.

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:51.960
Lucky. He gets Chizuru-sensei.

00:03:49.940 --> 00:03:51.960
<i>"That boy"? Gross.</i>

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:54.500
My mom used to teach at Oikawa.

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:58.000
But you know...

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.770
He doesn't <i>look </i>like the type to do ballet.

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:04.180
Oh, maybe it's because he just started.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:08.510
Really? It's pretty amazing to start at his age.

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:08.510
<i>It's fine. I don't care.</i>

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:11.770
<i>I'm the only one wearing 
a T-shirt and jeans.</i>

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:14.500
<i>It's like I'm in a different 
world or something...</i>

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:17.150
Oh, sorry...

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:28.650
<i>This isn't what I expected...</i>

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:34.610
Hey! You've gotta be kidding me!

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:36.750
You can't stand up right now!

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:40.560
Whew, that surprised me!

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:42.610
And after you called it a school recital...

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:44.740
The demon...

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:46.650
You mean Rothbart?

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:49.950
Yeah. And the princess and the prince.

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:54.660
Why were the three of them different?

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:58.370
Um...

00:05:58.640 --> 00:06:03.340
They're all amazing, though. It's one
 of Japan's top ballet companies.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:05.260
Well, those three especially.

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:09.760
They're either star dancers with the company 
or guest dancers from abroad...

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:11.950
Oh... I see.

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:13.670
Sorry, you can head home without me.

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:17.010
<i>I don't care about the reason.</i>

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:19.040
<i>I want to try</i>

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:21.020
<i>what I just saw!</i>

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:25.780
<i>All right!</i>

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:29.460
<i>That prince was dressed kinda weird,</i>

00:06:29.460 --> 00:06:31.030
<i>but he was still super regal.</i>

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.780
<i>The position of his legs...</i>

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:37.160
<i>The position of his fingers...</i>

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:40.570
<i>Gracefully...</i>

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:43.090
Did you follow me?!

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:49.840
<i>Oh, is she doing that dance?</i>

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:51.700
<i>Odile...</i>

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:02.750
<i>With the impression I have of Godai,</i>

00:07:03.030 --> 00:07:05.230
<i>she reminds me more of Princess Odette...</i>

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:16.330
Hey, let's dance together.

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:31.530
That's weird...

00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:33.650
The prince lifted her so easily...

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:43.940
Not even you can do a lift 
without any training.

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:47.360
When I said "let's dance together," 
I meant at the ballet festival.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:52.190
What's the matter, Murao?

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:55.430
What? Fine, we can dance now.

00:07:55.430 --> 00:07:56.620
Murao?

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:14.760
That faraway look is good.

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:17.680
Here. A present.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:19.040
Ballet clothes and shoes.

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:23.100
Morning!

00:08:23.490 --> 00:08:24.980
Miyako-oneechan!

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:26.670
Good morning.

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:28.360
Good morning.

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:29.240
Hey, old lady!

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:32.000
What's the deal with these perverted clothe—

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:35.520
The dance belt goes <i>under</i> your tights.

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:37.910
And please wear your T-shirt.

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:40.160
How to wear it properly

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:40.160
Example

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:40.020
<i>Ah, like this.</i>

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:44.100
What, what?

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:46.240
Nothing. I just remembered
 something funny.

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:48.440
Aw, what? Tell us!

00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:50.010
Did Godai laugh when she 
looked at you just now?

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:52.210
Huh?! You were just imagining it! I think...

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:53.930
She's cute.

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:55.340
Introduce me to her, yeah?

00:08:56.660 --> 00:08:59.360
What? We're not even that close.

00:08:59.360 --> 00:09:01.550
Yeah, what are you talking about?

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:04.600
She's a loser. She's part 
of the loser group.

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:09.870
Hey, she lives with that boy in our 
class who won't come to school, right?

00:09:09.870 --> 00:09:11.500
Oh, yeah. They're cousins or something?

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:14.990
What was his name again? 
I remember it was weird...

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:17.210
Um, Mori...

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:18.320
Luou!

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:20.080
<i>Luou-kun?</i>

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:22.080
<i>Huh? What?!</i>

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:24.830
Reverence. Put feeling into it.

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:28.080
Look into each other's eyes...

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.290
and take her hand.

00:09:30.950 --> 00:09:32.000
Don't get embarrassed!

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:36.510
<i>No, no, I can't do this!</i>

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:37.720
What?

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:40.100
Jumpei's shorter?

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:42.730
You had such a big attitude 
that I didn't notice!

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:44.160
What the heck?

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:45.880
On that note, how tall are your parents?

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:48.090
If you plan to be the prince of 
an overseas ballet company,

00:09:48.090 --> 00:09:50.160
it's better if you're close to 180 cm!

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:51.140
Huh?

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:53.360
What're you talking about, old lady?

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:56.530
Didn't you say it's too late 
for me to start now anyway?

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.420
Wow!

00:09:57.420 --> 00:09:58.340
Huh?

00:09:58.340 --> 00:09:59.240
Your feet!

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:03.610
What? I thought you scouted him 
because you'd noticed.

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:07.370
It's amazing that you were 
born with these feet.

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:10.520
You're just what ballet wants.

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:17.660
<i>"What ballet wants"...</i>

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:21.780
<i>That means I have the talent, right?</i>

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:32.290
<i>I...</i>

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.700
<i>want Godai to want me, too!</i>

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:37.690
<i>I want to lift her up!</i>

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:40.700
<i>I think...</i>

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:42.920
<i>I'll perform in the ballet
 festival after all.</i>

00:10:43.590 --> 00:10:46.010
<i>Will that make Godai happy?</i>

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:15.000
Hey, wai—

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:15.970
Hey, you.

00:11:17.180 --> 00:11:18.280
Luou-kun.

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:20.530
Oh?

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:22.730
Did Miyako give you the key?

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:26.370
You can't resist dancing, can you?

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:30.780
Hey, I have a proposition.

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:33.330
I said I'm not peeping!

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:34.630
Just give me your name!

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:38.000
Help me out here, old lady!

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:42.230
What are you doing here 
in the middle of the night?

00:11:42.810 --> 00:11:46.600
Um, well, I guess it was... uh, hormones...

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:48.650
I'll walk you home.

00:11:48.650 --> 00:11:51.540
N-No thanks! See you tomorrow!

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:56.230
Hey, the guy in the studio...

00:11:56.640 --> 00:11:57.620
What's his deal?

00:11:57.980 --> 00:11:59.110
Who is he?

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:04.140
The demon, Rothbart...

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:10.410
What the hell are you saying, old lady?

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:13.920
<i>So that's the boy who refuses 
to go to school, Luou?</i>

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:17.870
<i>The trajectory's burned into my eyes...</i>

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:19.990
<i>and won't go away.</i>

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:21.880
<b>Godai Ballet Studio</b>

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:23.470
Hey! About yesterday—

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:25.720
Oh, morning, Jumpei!

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:31.880
You were so embarrassed, 
you couldn't even hold her hand,

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:34.900
so we were discussing you two being
 on a first-name basis with each other.

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.480
You can call me "Miyako."

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:38.170
Mi!

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:38.740
Ya!

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:39.860
Ko!

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:40.800
Ch...

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:41.740
Almost.

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:43.140
Oh, but remember?

00:12:43.140 --> 00:12:47.120
You tried to lift me without 
warning the other day.

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:52.600
Oh, that was... Um, I thought 
I could do it because I'm the prince.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.090
You need muscle for high lifts,

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:56.560
but if you build those now, 
it'll stunt your growth.

00:12:56.560 --> 00:13:00.210
It's too hard on a growing body, 
so we won't do any right now.

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:00.980
Huh?!

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:04.700
Try an attitude, penché, promenade.

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:07.250
It's a sequence that's 
often used in Swan Lake.

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:10.400
What... kind of spell is that?

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:12.350
Just try it.

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:16.350
Jumpei, show me you can be a prince.

00:13:17.140 --> 00:13:19.630
<i>Easy for her to say...</i>

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:23.140
Okay, Jumpei, hold Miyako's waist.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.130
<i>Prince...</i>

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:27.180
<i>Prince... Prince...</i>

00:13:27.180 --> 00:13:28.200
<i>Prince!</i>

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:29.120
Ouch!

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:30.290
Sorry!

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:33.290
It's fine, it's fine. Let's do our best!

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:47.760
Luou!

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:55.490
<i>This really is Luou, huh?</i>

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:56.810
Are you going to practice?

00:13:58.060 --> 00:13:59.560
I'm so glad!

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:01.590
We can dance together again, right?

00:14:01.590 --> 00:14:02.930
Let's do our best!

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:07.630
Hey.

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:08.820
Don't leave.

00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:11.960
Remember our promise.

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:14.180
Perfect timing.

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:16.850
Attitude, penché, promenade...

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:18.830
Show Jumpei how to do it.

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:24.420
<i>What? Is he looking down on me?!</i>

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:26.160
Okay.

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:28.570
Attitude...

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:29.870
Penché...

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:31.550
Promenade.

00:14:38.590 --> 00:14:40.150
Yes, very good.

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:49.780
Oh, how lovely.

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:52.310
<i>What's up with this guy?</i>

00:14:52.310 --> 00:14:53.300
You know,

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:57.280
it's obvious that I'd make a 
better prince than him, right?

00:14:58.880 --> 00:15:00.170
<i>We're the same age,</i>

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:02.670
<i>but he's able to just embrace 
a girl's shoulders like that!</i>

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:05.670
<i>He's the kind of guy who can say 
crap like, "I should be the prince."</i>

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:08.990
<i>I can't be friends with someone like him!</i>

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:14.040
Chizuru-san, why am I Rothbart?
 A caractère?

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:16.810
Rothbart?!

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:20.690
Are you gonna wear that makeup?!

00:15:21.470 --> 00:15:23.420
Why is he doing ballet?

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:26.690
What part of this little 
wild monkey is a noble?

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:28.200
Huh?!

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:31.110
Bastard, just 'cause you're 
a little bigger than me—

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:34.490
In ballet,

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:37.160
someone small

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:38.680
can't be the prince.

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:39.250
Huh?

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:41.000
Your eyes are so light-colored.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:43.120
Are you a foreigner?

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:44.870
A quarter.

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:46.080
And,

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:47.500
Jumpei is the prince.

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:57.970
<i>I don't really get it,</i>

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:01.100
<i>but I'm the prince 
because I'm better, right?</i>

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:04.400
Okay, now it's Jumpei 
and Miyako's turn to try.

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:06.350
Don't make your fingers into claws.

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:08.760
Imagine that you're enveloping her.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:12.630
<i>I...</i>

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:14.030
<i>am the prince.</i>

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:15.030
<i>I...</i>

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:17.410
<i>am the one who will hold Miyako!</i>

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:22.310
It doesn't hurt!

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:24.440
That's it! That's it, Jumpei!

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:34.550
<i>I-I'm a monkey!</i>

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:36.680
<i>It's completely different from earlier!</i>

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:38.560
Okay, penché.

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:40.810
That hurts a little...

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:42.520
Oh, sorry!

00:16:44.680 --> 00:16:46.260
<i>Don't watch!</i>

00:16:46.260 --> 00:16:48.210
<i>Don't watch me!</i>

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:52.120
<i>What is with that guy?</i>

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:54.290
<i>During the barre exercises,</i>

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:57.120
<i>and the center work...</i>

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:59.120
<i>Damn it...</i>

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:03.370
<i>Comparing us is like looking at the 
difference between a man and a monkey.</i>

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:05.830
Jumpei!

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:08.400
What's up?

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:10.340
Oh, just taking a walk.

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:12.760
You live this way, Jumpei?

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:14.760
<i>Is she going to walk home with me?!</i>

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:18.140
Oh, um, sorry I suck so bad.

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:20.240
Are you talking about the pas de deux?

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:23.950
No one can do it well on the first try.

00:17:23.950 --> 00:17:24.980
Let's do our best.

00:17:25.990 --> 00:17:30.360
He's... been doing this 
since he was little, right?

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:35.300
Yeah.

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:38.200
He had a really strict teacher...

00:17:38.810 --> 00:17:42.000
But Luou started saying 
he wanted to quit ballet.

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:44.460
What?! But he's so good!

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:45.460
Why would he—

00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:48.790
Right?! That's how I feel, too!

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:54.870
Sorry about how Luou was acting earlier.

00:17:55.650 --> 00:17:58.540
He's not good at interacting with others.

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:01.040
Kind of your opposite, Jumpei.

00:18:02.160 --> 00:18:06.890
There are always people laughing 
and having fun around you.

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:08.650
When I see that,

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:12.400
I think, "That's nice."

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:17.200
<i>Hey, what kind of look do you 
have on your face right now?</i>

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:20.190
And then you did that 540 jump.

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:22.350
When I saw that, I thought

00:18:22.350 --> 00:18:25.040
maybe you could be friends with Luou...

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:28.290
And you two could work together...

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:38.700
Oh, you invited me to do ballet with you

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:41.160
so I could be Luou's friend...

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:42.720
<i>It was for Luou's sake.</i>

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:44.410
Yeah!

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:46.650
I thought if it was you...

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:50.220
You like Luou?

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:02.570
What?!

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:05.090
Oh, please! What are you saying?

00:19:05.090 --> 00:19:08.540
We're cousins! I'm just worried
 about him, that's all.

00:19:10.850 --> 00:19:12.900
<i>He's a prodigy! I really think so!</i>

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:14.210
<i>Let's dance together.</i>

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:20.890
Huh?

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:23.010
Jumpei?

00:19:30.460 --> 00:19:32.730
Why haven't you been coming to the studio?

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:35.110
Huh?

00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:38.540
I only skipped for two or three days.

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:41.140
I still have club and Jeet Kune Do, too.

00:19:41.140 --> 00:19:44.490
My mom says she wants to do the 
choreography for the ballet festival.

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:46.580
I can't perform in that.

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:49.350
I've got soccer training camp 
the same day. Sorry!

00:19:49.350 --> 00:19:50.960
Anyway—

00:19:49.720 --> 00:19:50.960
Jumpei!

00:19:51.720 --> 00:19:54.120
Godai-san, I'm Sagara Hyouta!

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:55.380
Yay!

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:57.340
Hey, what the heck?!

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:00.130
A friend of a friend is a friend, right?

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:04.640
<i>She already has someone much 
more suited to being a prince.</i>

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:06.580
<i>She doesn't need me.</i>

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:09.140
<b>Soccer Club</b>

00:20:23.620 --> 00:20:25.390
What's that noise supposed to be?

00:20:27.300 --> 00:20:29.540
This song is so cool, though.

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:32.240
I knew you'd like it, Hyou-chan!

00:20:32.240 --> 00:20:34.500
The guitar solo's so good, right?

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:36.690
I can't play, but I wanna try!

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:37.850
I want one!

00:20:38.360 --> 00:20:41.170
Then maybe I'll buy a drum set.

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:46.260
Hey, let's start a band.

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:52.520
That's...

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:54.520
so cool!

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:56.070
Right?!

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:01.030
<i>Jumpei, it's me.</i>

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:04.280
Voicemail
 Uncle Mioka

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:04.270
<i>When are you coming to Jeet Kune Do again?</i>

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:06.980
<i>Don't make your mom worry.</i>

00:21:06.980 --> 00:21:09.450
<i>I'm sure you can be a stunt 
coordinator like your dad—</i>

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:15.060
<i>I'm wanted...</i>

00:21:15.060 --> 00:21:17.250
<i>And not just by ballet.</i>

00:21:33.460 --> 00:21:34.430
<i>Rosie</i>

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:37.100
<i>Tell me, Rosie</i>

00:21:38.220 --> 00:21:39.930
<i>What do you want</i>

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:43.030
<i>Tell me, Rosie</i>

00:21:43.950 --> 00:21:45.680
<i>What do you wanna do</i>

00:21:50.050 --> 00:21:51.370
Jumpei!

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:54.760
What, you actually went 
to morning chorus practice?

00:21:54.760 --> 00:21:55.740
Seriously?

00:21:55.740 --> 00:21:57.000
No way!

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:58.750
He's here, you know. He's actually here!

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:00.750
The transfer student no one's seen yet.

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:00.750
<b>Staff Room</b>

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:03.830
Luou-kun!

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:35.890
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:36.450 --> 00:23:40.570
I chose to be cool and manly!

00:23:41.320 --> 00:23:43.120
As I dance in secret...

00:23:43.950 --> 00:23:48.190
<i>Dance Dance Danseur</i>, Act 3: 
"What Does It Mean to Be Manly?"

00:23:46.520 --> 00:23:49.900
Act 3 
"What Does It Mean to Be Manly?"
